1000:
Weave pattern error\n
Weave interpolation type error\n
[Geometric = 0, Rapid = 1]\n
\t\n
Adjust weave parameters
1001:
Weave pattern error\n
Weave pattern shape error\n
[No shape = 0, Zig-zag shape    = 1]\n
[V-shape  = 2, Triangular shape = 3]\n
\t\n
Adjust weave parameters
1002:
Weave pattern error\n
Weave pattern cycle length error\n
(0 - 1) [m]\n
\t\n
Adjust weave parameters
1003:
Weave pattern error\n
Weave pattern cycle time error\n
(0 - 100) [s]\n
\t\n
Adjust weave parameters
1004:
Weave pattern error\n
Weave pattern width error\n
(0 - 1) [m]\n
\t\n
Adjust weave parameters
1005:
Weave pattern error\n
Weave pattern height error\n
(0 - 1) [m]\n
\t\n
Adjust weave parameters
1006:
Weave pattern error\n
Weave pattern left dwell error\n
(0 - 1) [m]\n
\t\n
Adjust weave parameters
1007:
Weave pattern error\n
Weave pattern center dwell error\n
(0 - 1) [m]\n
\t\n
Adjust weave parameters
1008:
Weave pattern error\n
Weave pattern right dwell error\n
(0 - 1) [m]\n
\t\n
Adjust weave parameters
1009:
