1015:
Weave pattern error\n
Weave pattern sync condition left error\n
(0 - 100) [%]\n
\t\n
Adjust weave parameters
1016:
Weave pattern error\n
Weave pattern sync condition right error\n
(0 - 100) [%]\n
\t\n
