1017:
Weave pattern error\n
Forbidden combination of bias and shape\n
Bias only allowed for Zig-zag shape\n
\t\n
Adjust weave parameters
1018:
Weave pattern error\n
Forbidden combination of bias and width\n
Bias must be less than half the width\n
\t\n
Adjust weave parameters
1019:
Weave pattern error\n
Forbidden combination of dwells and\n
cycle length\n
Dwells must be less than cycle length\n
Ramp slope (amplitude/length) is limited\n
\t\n
Adjust weave parameters
