Equipment config error\n
\n
\t\n
AW and EIO configurations do not match
4000:
Weldguide error\n
\n
\t\n
Check weldguide parameters\n
and equipment
5000:
Seamless Config Error\n
Unknown parameter in\n
Power Source\n
\t\n
Check Seamless configuration file
